WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:16.283
Rover was a nice dog.

2
00:00:16.284 --> 00:00:21.255
But he chewed on shoes and socks.

3
00:00:21.256 --> 00:00:31.267
He dug up plants in the garden.

4
00:00:31.268 --> 00:00:41.384
Then one day Rover chased Mrs. Hart's kitten.

5
00:00:41.385 --> 00:00:43.988
"No, Rover!" cried Emmy.

6
00:00:43.989 --> 00:00:52.575
"Leave Ginger alone!"

7
00:00:52.576 --> 00:00:56.606
"Rover is a good dog," Mrs. Hart said.

8
00:00:56.607 --> 00:01:03.547
"But he needs to learn some manners!"

9
00:01:03.548 --> 00:01:07.685
Dad and Emmy took Rover to school.

10
00:01:07.686 --> 00:01:12.221
There were lots of other dogs there.

11
00:01:12.222 --> 00:01:16.266
The dogs and people formed a circle.

12
00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:19.121
"Sit," said the teacher.

13
00:01:19.122 --> 00:01:27.754
All the dogs sat—except Rover.

14
00:01:27.755 --> 00:01:31.387
"Speak," said the teacher.

15
00:01:31.388 --> 00:01:38.252
All the dogs barked—except Rover.

16
00:01:38.253 --> 00:01:41.638
"Fetch," said the teacher.

17
00:01:41.639 --> 00:01:52.297
All the dogs fetched—except Rover.

18
00:01:52.298 --> 00:01:54.916
Dad and Emmy sighed.

19
00:01:54.917 --> 00:01:59.509
"Rover is a hopeless dog," said Emmy.

20
00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:03.259
"He's never going to learn anything."

21
00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:10.585
Dad and Emmy took Rover home.

22
00:02:10.586 --> 00:02:16.788
Mrs. Hart was outside.

23
00:02:16.789 --> 00:02:20.110
"She's looking for something," said Dad.

24
00:02:20.111 --> 00:02:22.973
"Ginger!" called Mrs. Hart.

25
00:02:22.974 --> 00:02:25.852
"Where are you?"

26
00:02:25.853 --> 00:02:28.869
"Oh no," said Emmy.

27
00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:38.829
"Mrs. Hart's kitten is lost!"

28
00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:42.281
Suddenly Rover sat.

29
00:02:42.282 --> 00:02:47.648
He barked three times.

30
00:02:47.649 --> 00:02:56.680
Then he raced into the backyard.

31
00:02:56.681 --> 00:03:04.184
Soon he came back—with Ginger!

32
00:03:04.185 --> 00:03:07.906
"Good dog, Rover!" said Emmy proudly.

33
00:03:07.907 --> 00:03:14.071
"You know how to sit, speak, and fetch."

34
00:03:14.072 --> 00:03:17.368
Rover wagged his tail.

35
00:03:17.369 --> 00:03:20.149
Then he ran to the garden.

36
00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:27.404
"Oh no," Dad moaned.
